Subject: [PATCH] Add missing MCP resources (profile, goals, summary/month)

Adds three new MCP resources to complete the implementation of Issue #18:
- health://profile - user profile information (name, birth date, etc.)
- health://goals - user-defined health goals for metrics
- health://summary/month - monthly summary statistics

Includes proper error handling and schema validation for each resource.

Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>
